       01  SAVE-VENCODE                  PIC X(10)        VALUE SPACES.
       01  SAVE-VENNAME                  PIC X(44)        VALUE SPACES.
       01  SAVE-RCVG-CHAT-SW             PIC X            VALUE "N".
       01  SAVE-EXTSYS                   PIC X            VALUE "N".
       01  SAVE-EXTAUTO                  PIC X            VALUE "N".
       01  EXT-QTY                       PIC S9(8)  COMP-3  VALUE ZEROS.
       01  EXT-CORRECT                   PIC X(1)         VALUE SPACES.
       01  PLANT-NUMERIC                 PIC 999          VALUE ZEROES.
       01  STORE-SW                      PIC X            VALUE "N".
       01  ZERO-WS                       PIC 9(8)         VALUE 0.
